WEBVTT

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.346
Open the WhatsApp agent's Event Subscription

00:00:04.346 --> 00:00:05.348
The New subscription form is open

00:00:05.348 --> 00:00:13.295
Set the method and your callback URL

00:00:13.295 --> 00:00:17.450
A WhatsApp agent offers the four chat events only

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.627
Tick the events you want

00:00:20.627 --> 00:00:27.741
Add a header, such as an Authorization token

00:00:27.741 --> 00:00:30.724
Click Create Subscription

00:00:30.724 --> 00:00:32.402
The subscription lists its URL, events and headers

00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:35.406
Close a test chat with @||end_chat|| to receive chat_completed
